  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT\n\n### MTD IT - How to allow software to connect with HMRC\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 13 May, 2026 at  7:46 AM\n\n\t\tTo submit under MTD IT, you must first authorise the software to connect with HM Revenue & Customs. This process securely links your Agent Services Account (ASA) with the software, allowing it to interact with HMRC on your client’s behalf. \n\nNavigation: MTD IT >Manage > Select  Client >Start Authorisation\n\n1. Open the MTD IT \n\nFrom your dashboard, search for and open the relevant client.\n\nClick Start Authorisation \n\nClick on Authorise with HMRC (this may appear as Authorise Capium MTD IT).\n\nYou can also bulk authorise your clients as well. Please click here to view the article on how to bulk authorisation. \n\n2. HMRC Authorisation Process\n\n    Once clicked on Start Authorisation\n\n    You will be redirected to the HRMC authorisation page, select Continue\n\n    Click Sign in to the HRMC Online services.\n\n### 3. Complete HMRC Authorisation\n\n    Sign in using your Agent Services Account (ASA) credentials\n\n    Once signed in this will allow the software to connect with HRMC\n\n    Click Give permission.\n\nFor the next step, once you have signed up you have to prove your identity with HMRC providing the following information. \n\n4. HMRC Confirmation & Status Update\n\n    Once the authorisation is approved, HMRC will confirm the request.\n\n    You will then be redirected back to Capium automatically.\n\n    The client’s MTD IT status should update to Authorised.\n\nNote: If the status does not update immediately, refresh the page or re-open the client record to confirm the authorisation has been successfully applied.\n\nYou will  be able to review and verify the client’s income sources and proceed with setting up the tax return within the system.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
